[#4471](/kb/incidents/4471) is marked known: one bug, one fix queued. Its reports, read by tenant
and by body, describe three problems. The fix queued for the parser closes only the first.

<Callout kind="warn">
Not one issue. Each problem below had its own ticket; all three are now closed.
